==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[caffre]], [[kaffer]], [[kafir]], [[kaphar]], [[kaphir]], [[kafari]]

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ar|en}} {{term|كفار|lang=ar|tr=kaffār||infidel}} or {{term|كافر|lang=ar|tr=kāfir||unbeliever}}, both from {{term|كفر|lang=ar|tr=káfara||to cover, to hide}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|South Africa|pejorative|offensive|ethnic slur|lang=en}} A [[black]] person.
{{seeCites}}

